  "description": "Confidence Fashion Figure | 18 Poses\nCreate bold and self-assured fashion sketches with this collection of 18 confidence-inspired fashion figure poses for Procreate.\nDesigned for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features strong, powerful, and fashion-forward poses that help bring confidence, attitude, and personality to your designs.\nThe Confidence Collection is perfect for contemporary womenswear, editorial fashion concepts, lookbook development, runway presentations, portfolio projects, fashion campaigns, and client presentations.\nThese fashion figure poses provide a professional foundation for sketching garments while maintaining clean fashion proportions and expressive body language.\nSimply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 18 Confidence Fashion Figure Poses\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)\n• High-Quality Fashion Figure Bases\n• Installation Guide\n• Preview Images\nPERFECT FOR\n• Fashion Designers\n• Fashion Students\n• Fashion Illustrators\n• Apparel Brands\n• Clothing Designers\n• Procreate Users\n• Digital Artists\nUSE FOR\n• Fashion Sketching\n• Editorial Fashion Design\n• Fashion Illustration\n• Collection Planning\n• Lookbook Development\n• Portfolio Projects\n• Client Presentations\n• Digital Fashion Design\nFEATURES\n• 18 Confidence Fashion Figure Poses\n• Professional Fashion Proportions\n• Strong and Expressive Poses\n• Easy Stamp Workflow\n• Time-Saving Design Resource\n• Optimized for Procreate\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCompatible with Procreate for iPad.\nPlease ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.\nABOUT HYDNSTUDIO\nHYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Confidence Fashion Figure | 18 Poses</p>\n<p>Create bold and self-assured fashion sketches with this collection of 18 confidence-inspired fashion figure poses for Procreate.</p>\n<p>Designed for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features strong, powerful, and fashion-forward poses that help bring confidence, attitude, and personality to your designs.</p>\n<p>The Confidence Collection is perfect for contemporary womenswear, editorial fashion concepts, lookbook development, runway presentations, portfolio projects, fashion campaigns, and client presentations.</p>\n<p>These fashion figure poses provide a professional foundation for sketching garments while maintaining clean fashion proportions and expressive body language.</p>\n<p>Simply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED</p>\n<p>• 18 Confidence Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)<br>\n• High-Quality Fashion Figure Bases<br>\n• Installation Guide<br>\n• Preview Images</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR</p>\n<p>• Fashion Designers<br>\n• Fashion Students<br>\n• Fashion Illustrators<br>\n• Apparel Brands<br>\n• Clothing Designers<br>\n• Procreate Users<br>\n• Digital Artists</p>\n<p>USE FOR</p>\n<p>• Fashion Sketching<br>\n• Editorial Fashion Design<br>\n• Fashion Illustration<br>\n• Collection Planning<br>\n• Lookbook Development<br>\n• Portfolio Projects<br>\n• Client Presentations<br>\n• Digital Fashion Design</p>\n<p>FEATURES</p>\n<p>• 18 Confidence Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Professional Fashion Proportions<br>\n• Strong and Expressive Poses<br>\n• Easy Stamp Workflow<br>\n• Time-Saving Design Resource<br>\n• Optimized for Procreate<br>\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals</p>\n<p>COMPATIBILITY</p>\n<p>Compatible with Procreate for iPad.</p>\n<p>Please ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE</p>\n<p>This is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.</p>\n<p>ABOUT HYDNSTUDIO</p>\n<p>HYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.</p>",
